From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:57:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Print artifact coordinates with errors and warnings in quiet
 mode

The coordinate header for each artifact was always logged at LIFECYCLE, which
Gradle hides with --quiet, while the errors and warnings beneath it were still
shown. Log the header at the most severe level of its results instead so it is
visible whenever any of its results are.

Fixes #545
